        question: String.raw`A 65.25~g sample of \ce{CuSO4*5H2O} ($M = 249.7$) is dissolved in enough water to make 0.800~L of solution. What volume of this solution must be diluted with water to make 1.00~L of 0.100~M \ce{CuSO4}?`,
