        year: 2013,
        number: 14,
        topic: "States of Matter",
        question: String.raw`In a mixture of \ce{N2} and \ce{O2} gases, the mol fraction of \ce{N2} is found to be 0.700. The total pressure of the mixture is 1.42~atm. What is the partial pressure of \ce{O2} in the mixture?`,
