        question: "Three metals, A, B and C, with solutions of their respective cations are tested in a voltaic cell with the following results; A and B: A is the cathode B and C: C is the cathode A and C: A is the anode What is the order of the reduction potentials from highest to lowest for the cations of these metals?",
