        year: 2014,
        number: 29,
        topic: "Kinetics",
        question: String.raw`A first-order reaction is carried out at several different temperatures. The data are plotted as ln $k$ vs 1/T. How is the slope of the graph related to $E_{\mathrm{a}}$?`,
