        question: String.raw`The rate of decomposition of hydrogen peroxide is first order in \ce{H2O2}. \ce{At} \ce{[H2O2]} = 0.150~M, the decomposition rate was measured to be $4.83 \times 10^{-6} \mathrm{M}\cdot\mathrm{s}^{-1}$. What is the rate constant for the reaction?`,
