        exam_type: "local",
        year: 2016,
        number: 1,
        topic: "Stoichiometry/Solutions",
        question: String.raw`A 20.0~g sample of mercury(II) oxide (\ce{HgO}, $M = 216.6$) is heated strongly, causing it to decompose to metallic \ce{Hg} and \ce{O2} gas. What volume of \ce{O2} gas is produced (measured at STP)?`,
