        exam_type: "local",
        year: 2016,
        number: 2,
        topic: "Stoichiometry/Solutions",
        question: String.raw`When 30.0~mL of 0.10~M \ce{AgNO3} is added to 30.0~mL of 0.10~M \ce{NaCl}, aqueous \ce{NaNO3} and solid \ce{AgCl} are formed. How much solid \ce{AgCl} is produced?`,
