        number: 3,
        topic: "Stoichiometry/Solutions",
        question: String.raw`How much \ce{Sr(OH)2} • 8 \ce{H2O} ($M = 265.76$) is needed to prepare 250.0~mL of solution in which \ce{[OH-]} = 0.100~M?`,
