        question: String.raw`An aqueous solution of potassium sulfate \ce{(K2SO4)} has a freezing point of $-2.24\,^\circ\mathrm{C}$. What is its molality? ($K_{\mathrm{f}} = 1.86\,^\circ\mathrm{C}\cdotm^{-1}$)`,
