        topic: "Equilibrium",
        question: String.raw`What mass of silver chloride ($M = 143.4$) will dissolve in 1.00~L of water? The $K_{\mathrm{sp}}$ of \ce{AgCl} is $1.8 \times 10^{-10}$.`,
