        year: 2018,
        number: 53,
        topic: "Bonding/Molecular Structure",
        question: String.raw`The bond in gas-phase \ce{O2} (121~pm) is significantly longer than the bond in gas-phase \ce{O2+} (112~pm). What is the best explanation for this difference?`,
        question_image: false,
        answer: "A",
