        exam_type: "local",
        year: 2019,
        number: 26,
        topic: "Kinetics",
        question: String.raw`A sample of 0.900~mol \ce{N2O} is placed in a sealed container, where it decomposes irreversibly to \ce{N2} and \ce{O2} in a first-order reaction. After 42.0~min, 0.640~mol \ce{N2O} remains. How long will it take for the reaction to be 90.0\% complete?`,
