        topic: "Equilibrium",
        question: String.raw`Chromium(III) hydroxide has $K_{\mathrm{sp}} = 1.6 \times 10^{-30}$. What is the molar solubility of \ce{Cr(OH)3} in a solution whose pH is maintained at 6.00?`,
