        question: String.raw`A current of 0.44 A is passed through a solution of a ruthenium nitrate salt, causing reduction of the metal ion to the metal. After 25.0 minutes, 0.345~g of \ce{Ru(s)} has been deposited. What is the oxidation state of ruthenium in the nitrate salt?`,
