        question: String.raw`A 2.00~g sample of ice at $0.0\,^\circ\mathrm{C}$ is placed in 50.0~g of water initially at $25.0\,^\circ\mathrm{C}$ in an insulated container. What is the final temperature after the system has achieved equilibrium? (For ice, $\Delta H^\circ_{\mathrm{fusion}} = 6.01$ kJ $\mathrm{mol}^{-1}$.)`,
        question_image: false,
