        year: 2020,
        number: 32,
        topic: "Equilibrium",
        question: String.raw`A solution of ammonia, \ce{NH3}, has pH = 11.50. What is the ammonia concentration? (The $\mathrm{p}K_{\mathrm{a}}$ of \ce{NH4+} is 9.24.)`,
