        exam_type: "local",
        year: 2020,
        number: 52,
        topic: "Bonding/Molecular Structure",
        question: String.raw`One Lewis structure of squarate ion, \ce{C4O4^2-}, is shown below. Which statement best describes the bond distances in the squarate ion?`,
