        year: 2022,
        number: 42,
        topic: "Oxidation - Reduction",
        question: String.raw`The standard reduction potential of oxygen under acidic conditions at 298~K is +1.23~V. What is the standard reduction potential for the four-electron reduction of \ce{O2(g)} under basic conditions?`,
        question_image: false,
        answer: "D",
