        exam_type: "national-I",
        year: 1999,
        number: 33,
        topic: "Equilibrium",
        question: String.raw`The ion-product constant for water at $45\,^\circ\mathrm{C}$ is $4.0 \times 10^{-14}$. What is the pH of pure water at this temperature?`,
