            C: String.raw`5.09~g of iron pyrite (d = $4.9 \mathrm{g}\cdot\mathrm{mL}^{-1}$)`,
            D: String.raw`2.68~g of oak (d = $0.72 \mathrm{g}\cdot\mathrm{mL}^{-1}$)`
