        question: String.raw`A solution of \ce{Pb(NO3)2} is added dropwise to a second solution in which \ce{[Cl-]} = \ce{[F-]} = \ce{[I-]} = \ce{[SO4^2-]} = 0.001~M. What is the first precipitate that forms?`,
