        year: 2017,
        number: 18,
        topic: "States of Matter",
        question: String.raw`A unit cell of the cubic form of \ce{ZnS} is shown below (large spheres = \ce{Zn}, small spheres = S). How many of each type of atom are present in one unit cell?`,
