        exam_type: "national-I",
        year: 2017,
        number: 24,
        topic: "Thermodynamics",
        question: String.raw`A solution containing 0.060~mol \ce{NaOH} dissolved in 200~g water was treated with successive aliquots of 6.0~M aqueous \ce{HCl} in a well-insulated flask, and the temperature was measured after each aliquot to give the following data:

The same experiment was repeated, again using 0.060~mol \ce{NaOH} and 6.0~M aqueous \ce{HCl}, but this time the \ce{NaOH} was initially dissolved in 400~g water. Which graph represents the data obtained in this experiment?`,
        question_image: true,
