        exam_type: "national-I",
        year: 2019,
        number: 56,
        topic: "Organic/Biochemistry",
        question: String.raw`How many distinct compounds of the formula \ce{C5H11Cl} can be formed by free radical chlorination of 2- methylbutane?`,
