        topic: "Oxidation - Reduction",
        question: String.raw`In basic solution, \ce{Cl2(g)} disproportionates to form \ce{Cl-(aq)} and \ce{ClO3-(aq)}. What is the mole ratio of \ce{Cl-(aq)} to \ce{ClO3-(aq)} produced in this reaction?`,
